#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:1
msgid ""
"VTK Wedge Cell Types: Fix Point Ordering, Triangulation and Volume "
"Correctness"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:3
msgid ""
"This series of commits fixes long-standing issues with wedge cell types in "
"VTK, where point orderings were inconsistent with parametric coordinates, "
"leading to incorrect volume computations, negative volume tetrahedra in "
"triangulations, and faces with incorrect outward normals. The fixes are "
"mentioned below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:8
msgid "`vtkWedge`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:9
msgid ""
"Fix documentation and drawing: the point ordering in the vtk-examples and "
"vtk-book was wrong and did not match the cell's parametric coordinates; this "
"has been corrected"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:11
msgid ""
"Wrong Wedge Point Ordering: ![Old Wedge Point Ordering](../imgs/9.7/"
"WedgeWrong.png)"
msgstr ""

