"WedgeCorrected.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:12
msgid "New Wedge Point Ordering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/fix-wedge-point-ordering.md:13
msgid ""
"Use outward normal winding for each face, which was broken as a result of "
"the incorrect point ordering"
msgstr ""

